<PageLayout title={'Chemical Exposure Sampling'} description={'CEM provides full and comprehensive air contaminant sampling in all areas of industrial hygiene. The field sampling team conducts:'} sidebar="services">
  <h4>DESCRIPTION</h4>
  <p>CEM provides full and comprehensive air contaminant sampling in all areas of industrial hygiene. The field sampling team conducts:</p>
  <ul>
  <li>Indoor Air Quality Evaluations.</li>
  <li>Employee exposure level monitoring and assessments.</li>
  <li>Health and safety risk assessments.</li>
  <li>Airborne contaminant sampling identification.</li>
  <li>Noise level assessments.</li>
  <li>Heating, cooling, and ventilation system reviews.</li>
  </ul>
  <h4>WHAT YOU RECEIVE</h4>
  <p>Our clients receive:</p>
  <ul>
  <li>Degreed professionals—each member of the sampling team has at least a baccalaureate degree and is experienced in providing state-of-the-art Sampling Services and Strategies.</li>
  <li>An in-depth understanding of the OSHA and NIOSH sampling procedures that delivers the optimum protocol, maximizing the effectiveness of samples while minimizing your costs.</li>
  <li>Assurance the appropriate media will be used to obtain valid results.</li>
  <li>Chain of custody procedures to track each sample, ensuring quality results and sample integrity at each step of the sampling and analytical process.</li>
  <li>Integrated communication with the CEM laboratory, minimizing the total process time and improving the quality of the output.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
